    "body": "In order to start planning the implementation of this feature, it would be good to obtain a few usage example/suggestions.\r\n\r\n@kevinsung how would you envision this to be used? Are you thinking of something along the lines of what `np.transpose` can do:\r\n```python\r\n>>> x = np.ones((1, 2, 3))\r\n>>> np.transpose(x, (1, 0, 2)).shape\r\n(2, 1, 3)\r\n```\r\nOr something entirely different?",
