    "updated_at": "2022-11-14T16:02:00Z",
    "body": "Yes, something like that is good. It could be a standalone function or a method. Example:\r\nfunction:\r\n```python\r\npermuted = permute_indices(op, (1, 0, 3, 2))\r\n```\r\nmethod:\r\n```python\r\npermuted = op.permute_indices((1, 0, 3, 2))\r\n```",
